                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>Lee los principios que nos rigen, políticas y estructuras de gobernanza que forman nuestra cultura ética.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/cobc/cobc_English.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Nuestro Código de Conducta Empresarial&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/about/our-commitment-to-human-rights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Nuestro Compromiso con los Derechos Humanos&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/about/pricing-and-access-of-our-innovative-medicines.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Costos y Acceso a Nuestros Medicamentos Innovadores&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/about/abbvie-governance-guidelines.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Nuestras Guías de Gobernanza Corporativa&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/suppliers/abbvie-supplier-code-of-conduct-brochure.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Nuestras Guías para los Suplidores &lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/about/our-commitment-to-product-donations.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Nuestro Compromiso con la Donación de Productos&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/about/statement-of-opposition-to-capital-punishment.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Declaración&amp;nbsp;Respecto a la Oposición del Uso de Productos de AbbVie en Inyecciones Letales para el Castigo Capital&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/about/our-position-on-tax.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Nuestra Posición Respecto&amp;nbsp;a Impuestos&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd